</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Leaning our heads on Jesus’ breast,</l><l>Knowing the joy of that sweet rest,</l><l>Finding in Him the chief, the best,</l><l>Hallelujah! Hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Kept by His pow’r from day to day,</l><l>Held by His hand, we cannot stray,</l><l>Glory to glory all the way,</l><l>Hallelujah! Hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Living in us His own pure life,</l><l>Giving us rest from inward strife,</l><l>From strength to strength, from death to life,</l><l>Hallelujah! Hallelujah!</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>O what a Savior we have found;</l><l>Well may we make the world resound</l><l>With one continual joyous sound,</l><l>Hallelujah! Hallelujah!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
